"use strict";(self.webpackChunkanh=self.webpackChunkanh||[]).push([[838],{9178:e=>{e.exports=JSON.parse('{"blogPosts":[{"id":"chat","metadata":{"permalink":"/anhle_api/vn/blog/chat","source":"@site/blog/chat/index.md","title":"Chat","description":"OTT","date":"2024-05-24T15:57:49.000Z","formattedDate":"May 24, 2024","tags":[{"label":"chat","permalink":"/anhle_api/vn/blog/tags/chat"},{"label":"ott","permalink":"/anhle_api/vn/blog/tags/ott"},{"label":"zalo","permalink":"/anhle_api/vn/blog/tags/zalo"},{"label":"facebook","permalink":"/anhle_api/vn/blog/tags/facebook"}],"readingTime":0.49,"hasTruncateMarker":false,"authors":[{"name":"Le Tuan Anh(AnhLe)","title":"Owner of AnhLe API","url":"https://github.com/Besanh","imageURL":"https://github.com/Besanh.png","key":"anhle"}],"frontMatter":{"slug":"chat","title":"Chat","authors":["anhle"],"tags":["chat","ott","zalo","facebook"]},"nextItem":{"title":"C.R.M","permalink":"/anhle_api/vn/blog/crm"}},"content":"![OTT](./ott.jpeg)\\n\\nThe `main ott service` includes 2 main services: `ott service` and `chat service`.\\n\\n`ott service` handles requests sent from Facebook/Zalo and is also the final processing location for messages to reach Facebook/Zalo from CRM and CCP (Call Center Pro) systems.\\n\\nMeanwhile, the `chat service` is where data is received and processed from the ott service, performing storage and pushing information to integrated systems (such as Crm), while also receiving information from integrated systems, then processing it before sending it to the ott service.\\n\\nBelow is the architecture of the main ott service.\\n\\n![Main ott service](./design_system.png)\\n\\n![Chat UI](./chat.png)"},{"id":"crm","metadata":{"permalink":"/anhle_api/vn/blog/crm","source":"@site/blog/crm/index.md","title":"C.R.M","description":"C.R.M","date":"2024-05-24T15:57:49.000Z","formattedDate":"May 24, 2024","tags":[{"label":"crm","permalink":"/anhle_api/vn/blog/tags/crm"},{"label":"contact center","permalink":"/anhle_api/vn/blog/tags/contact-center"},{"label":"multi channel","permalink":"/anhle_api/vn/blog/tags/multi-channel"},{"label":"email","permalink":"/anhle_api/vn/blog/tags/email"}],"readingTime":0.22,"hasTruncateMarker":false,"authors":[],"frontMatter":{"slug":"crm","title":"C.R.M","authors":[],"tags":["crm","contact center","multi channel","email"]},"prevItem":{"title":"Chat","permalink":"/anhle_api/vn/blog/chat"},"nextItem":{"title":"Welcome","permalink":"/anhle_api/vn/blog/welcome"}},"content":"![C.R.M](./crm.png)\\n\\nCRM is a customer support product. In addition to connecting call centers for call handling and\\nmulti-channel integration such as [Chat](https://besanh.github.io/anhle_api/blog/chat)chat, SMS, ZNS and email, it also enables companies to reach,\\nengage and serve customers in the best possible way.\\n\\n![Contact](./contact.png)\\n\\n![Contact](./ticket.png)\\n\\n![Contact](./unit.png)"},{"id":"welcome","metadata":{"permalink":"/anhle_api/vn/blog/welcome","source":"@site/blog/2021-08-26-welcome/index.md","title":"Welcome","description":"Docusaurus blogging features are powered by the blog plugin.","date":"2021-08-26T00:00:00.000Z","formattedDate":"August 26, 2021","tags":[{"label":"facebook","permalink":"/anhle_api/vn/blog/tags/facebook"},{"label":"hello","permalink":"/anhle_api/vn/blog/tags/hello"},{"label":"docusaurus","permalink":"/anhle_api/vn/blog/tags/docusaurus"}],"readingTime":0.405,"hasTruncateMarker":false,"authors":[],"frontMatter":{"slug":"welcome","title":"Welcome","authors":[],"tags":["facebook","hello","docusaurus"]},"prevItem":{"title":"C.R.M","permalink":"/anhle_api/vn/blog/crm"}},"content":"[Docusaurus blogging features](https://docusaurus.io/docs/blog) are powered by the [blog plugin](https://docusaurus.io/docs/api/plugins/@docusaurus/plugin-content-blog).\\n\\nSimply add Markdown files (or folders) to the `blog` directory.\\n\\nRegular blog authors can be added to `authors.yml`.\\n\\nThe blog post date can be extracted from filenames, such as:\\n\\n- `2019-05-30-welcome.md`\\n- `2019-05-30-welcome/index.md`\\n\\nA blog post folder can be convenient to co-locate blog post images:\\n\\n![Docusaurus Plushie](./docusaurus-plushie-banner.jpeg)\\n\\nThe blog supports tags as well!\\n\\n**And if you don\'t want a blog**: just delete this directory, and use `blog: false` in your Docusaurus config."}]}')}}]);